                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "An awesome deal for its price.\n\nFirst of all, it has a very interesting concept.\n\nThe characters are cute, background graphics are breathtaking, the tutorial is simple and nice, the puzzles are interesting and story-line is quite tear-jerking, I had an enjoyable fun time through the entire game.\n\nThe voice acting is quite good, only a few lines had unnatural voice acting.\n\nThe only issue that I found might be hard to adapt to for some players, unbindable keys.\nWith regards to it, I've contacted the developer with regards to it, so it might have a bindable key option in the near future.\n\nI would recommend this game to players who wants to have a stressless fun time while enjoying the beautiful graphics and scenery.\n\nI do believe this game will appeal more to people with patience.\n\n*Spoiler : 2 endings*",
